{"seq":1,"slug":"sequence-containers","title":"序列容器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/cpp-fundamentals/stl-containers/sequence-containers","wordCount":1001,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"序列容器\">序列容器</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>STL（Standard Template Library）序列容器是 C++ 中最常用的数据结构集合，它们以线性顺序组织元素，支持按位置访问。主要包括 std::vector（动态数组）、std::array（固定大小数组）、std::deque（双端队列）、std::list（双向链表）和 std::forward_list（单向链表）。选择正确的序列容器是 C++ 性能优化的基础决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[STL 序列容器] --&gt; B[vector 动态数组]&#10;    A --&gt; C[array 固定数组]&#10;    A --&gt; D[deque 双端队列]&#10;    A --&gt; E[list 双向链表]&#10;    A --&gt; F[forward_list 单向链表]&#10;    B --&gt; G[连续内存 ✓]&#10;    B --&gt; H[随机访问 O1]&#10;    B --&gt; I[尾部插入均摊 O1]&#10;    D --&gt; J[分段连续内存]&#10;    D --&gt; K[首尾插入 O1]&#10;    E --&gt; L[非连续内存]&#10;    E --&gt; M[任意位置插入 O1]\">graph TD\n    A[STL 序列容器] --&gt; B[vector 动态数组]\n    A --&gt; C[array 固定数组]\n    A --&gt; D[deque 双端队列]\n    A --&gt; E[list 双向链表]\n    A --&gt; F[forward_list 单向链表]\n    B --&gt; G[连续内存 ✓]\n    B --&gt; H[随机访问 O1]\n    B --&gt; I[尾部插入均摊 O1]\n    D --&gt; J[分段连续内存]\n    D --&gt; K[首尾插入 O1]\n    E --&gt; L[非连续内存]\n    E --&gt; M[任意位置插入 O1]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>容器</th>\n<th>随机访问</th>\n<th>头部插入</th>\n<th>尾部插入</th>\n<th>中间插入</th>\n<th>内存布局</th>\n<th>迭代器失效</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>vector</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>均摊 O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>扩容时全部失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>array</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>N/A</td>\n<td>连续栈上</td>\n<td>不失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>deque</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>分段连续</td>\n<td>首尾插入不失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>list</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>非连续</td>\n<td>仅删除元素失效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>forward_list</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>非连续</td>\n<td>仅删除元素失效</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"vector-深入\">vector 深入</h2><p>std::vector 是 C++ 最常用的容器，它在堆上分配一块连续内存存储元素。当容量不足时执行扩容（通常 2 倍），将所有元素移动到新内存。理解 size、capacity 和扩容策略是高效使用 vector 的关键：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;vector&gt;&#10;#include &lt;algorithm&gt;&#10;#include &lt;numeric&gt;&#10;&#10;void demonstrate_vector() {&#10;    std::vector&lt;int&gt; vec;&#10;    vec.reserve(1000);           // 预分配容量，避免扩容&#10;&#10;    for (int i = 0; i &lt; 1000; ++i) {&#10;        vec.push_back(i);        // 不触发扩容&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    vec.emplace_back(42);        // 原地构造，避免临时对象&#10;&#10;    vec.erase(&#10;        std::remove_if(vec.begin(), vec.end(),&#10;            [](int x) { return x % 2 == 0; }),&#10;        vec.end()                // erase-remove 惯用法&#10;    );&#10;&#10;    vec.shrink_to_fit();         // 释放多余容量&#10;&#10;    auto sum = std::accumulate(vec.begin(), vec.end(), 0);&#10;&#10;    std::sort(vec.begin(), vec.end());&#10;    bool found = std::binary_search(vec.begin(), vec.end(), 42);&#10;&#10;    auto it = std::lower_bound(vec.begin(), vec.end(), 42);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;vector></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;algorithm></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;numeric></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demonstrate_vector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::vector</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;int></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vec;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">reserve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           // 预分配容量，避免扩容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push_back</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(i);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 不触发扩容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">emplace_back</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        // 原地构造，避免临时对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">erase</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">remove_if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">begin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            [](</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> x</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) { </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">%</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                // erase-remove 惯用法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">shrink_to_fit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">         // 释放多余容量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">accumulate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">begin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sort</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">begin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> found </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">binary_search</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">begin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> it </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">lower_bound</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">begin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), vec.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">end</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">42</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>vector 的扩容策略和迭代器失效是面试和实际编程中的高频问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>是否可能扩容</th>\n<th>迭代器失效</th>\n<th>安全建议</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>push_back</td>\n<td>是（size == capacity）</td>\n<td>扩容时全部失效</td>\n<td>预先 reserve</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>emplace_back</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>同 push_back</td>\n<td>同上</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>insert</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>插入点之后全部失效</td>\n<td>使用返回的迭代器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>erase</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>删除点之后全部失效</td>\n<td>使用返回的迭代器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>clear</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>全部失效</td>\n<td>size 归零 capacity 不变</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>reserve</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>扩容时全部失效</td>\n<td>一次性预分配</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"deque-与-array\">deque 与 array</h2><p>deque（双端队列）在首尾两端都支持 O(1) 插入，内部使用分段连续内存（块数组 + 固定大小的块）。array 是编译期固定大小的栈上数组，是 C 风格数组的安全替代：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"#include &lt;deque&gt;&#10;#include &lt;array&gt;&#10;&#10;void demonstrate_deque() {&#10;    std::deque&lt;int&gt; dq;&#10;    dq.push_back(1);&#10;    dq.push_front(0);          // O(1) 首部插入&#10;    dq.push_back(2);&#10;&#10;    int front = dq.front();    // 0&#10;    int back = dq.back();      // 2&#10;    int mid = dq[1];           // 1（随机访问）&#10;&#10;    dq.pop_front();&#10;    dq.pop_back();&#10;}&#10;&#10;void demonstrate_array() {&#10;    std::array&lt;int, 5&gt; arr = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};&#10;&#10;    constexpr auto size = arr.size();  // 编译期已知&#10;&#10;    int sum = 0;&#10;    for (const auto&amp; val : arr) {&#10;        sum += val;&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    auto [a, b, c, d, e] = arr;       // 结构化绑定&#10;&#10;    std::sort(arr.begin(), arr.end());&#10;&#10;    constexpr std::array&lt;int, 3&gt; compile_time = {10, 20, 30};&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;deque></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#include</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> &#x3C;array></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demonstrate_deque</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::deque</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;int></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dq;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push_back</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push_front</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // O(1) 首部插入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push_back</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> front </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">front</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> back </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">back</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dq[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           // 1（随机访问）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pop_front</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dq.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pop_back</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> demonstrate_array</span><s